1
00:00:00,250 --> 00:00:03,346
Voilà ton café, Adrien.
Here's your coffee, Adrien.

2
00:00:03,646 --> 00:00:05,710
Merci beaucoup !
Thank you very much!

3
00:00:06,010 --> 00:00:07,954
Je t'en prie !
You're welcome!

4
00:00:08,254 --> 00:00:10,534
C'est vraiment gentil !
That's really kind!

5
00:00:10,834 --> 00:00:13,642
De rien, c'est normal.
It's nothing, it's normal.

6
00:00:13,942 --> 00:00:16,078
Merci mille fois !
A thousand thanks!

7
00:00:16,378 --> 00:00:18,610
Il n'y a pas de quoi !
Don't mention it!

8
00:00:18,910 --> 00:00:20,998
Tu es la meilleure !
You're the best!

